<title>USA: Foundation, Health Systems merger advances.</title>
<headline>Foundation, Health Systems merger advances.</headline>
<dateline>PUEBLO, Colo. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foundation Health Corp and Health Systems International Inc on Wednesday said stockholders of both companies approved their pending merger.</p>
<p>The deal, announced in October, is worth about $3 billion.</p>
<p>Under the merger, Foundation would become a subsidiary of Health Systems, which would then change its name to Foundation Health Systems Inc.</p>
